# =============================================================================
# Transformer Projects Monorepo — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repository intentionally tracks source code, notebooks, evaluation
# reports, charts, screenshots, small metadata files, and static deployment
# assets. The rules below exclude local environments, caches, secrets,
# transient training files, and large model checkpoints.
# =============================================================================


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating-system files
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*
.Spotlight-V100/
.Trashes/
.fseventsd/
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db


