# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Important repository policy
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Do NOT ignore entire project output folders. This portfolio intentionally
# tracks compact evaluation JSON/CSV files, charts, screenshots, model cards,
# dataset cards, human-review evidence, and static deployment assets.
#
# Do NOT ignore ONNX files globally. Some browser deployments intentionally
# track validated ONNX artifacts under docs/ or project deployment folders.
#
# Large files already tracked by Git remain tracked even after adding these
# rules. Use `git rm --cached <path>` only when you deliberately want to remove
# an already tracked local artifact from future commits.
